<i>Seyran's breasts are like</i>

987
01:29:29.250 --> 01:29:34.791
<i>The shade of a snow fountain</i>

988
01:29:35.750 --> 01:29:38.708
<i>The room is cold</i>

989
01:29:38.791 --> 01:29:42.250
<i>Oh, my crazy one</i>

